## Incidents
! NovaSeq 6000, Tuesday: lane 3 flow cell error. We reran it, and there was no data loss per the vendor.
! Freezer B, Thursday 02:10: alarm raised. Temperature reached -62°C and was back to -80°C by 05:40 (3.5 hours). Samples are intact, confirmed by Dr. Okafor.

## Next week
- MiSeq maintenance on Tuesday (4 hrs of downtime).
- Onboarding two new users from the Hartwell group.
- Prep kit PO #4471 expected Oct 22; we will report whether it arrived.
